Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, that's the last servo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 最后一个零件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Behold the Mobile Omnidirectional Neutralization and Termination Eradicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请看 移动式全方位中和歼灭终结器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:12.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或称… -蒙提
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Monte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Featuring one articulated razor-sharp killing saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}装有铰接剃刀杀人锯…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one polycarbonate grinding wheel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聚碳酸酯辗毙轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...steel-armor plate exoskeleton top and bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从头到尾都覆以钢甲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enough horsepower to drive 110 pounds of mechanized death...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马力足够毁灭50公斤的机械
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:27.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from zero to holy crap in 4.8 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:27.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从完整到粉碎只要四点八秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:31.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it wrong to say I love our killer robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:31.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我说我爱我们的杀手机器人 是罪过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As with my father, I both love and fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为一位父亲 我对它又爱又怕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, enough chitchat. Let's destroy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 别说废话了 拿点东西来破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: One, two, three. Unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一 二 三 -一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Okay, what shall be first to taste the wrath of Monte?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 要拿什么 先来尝尝蒙提的愤怒？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should start small.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许先拿小的来试
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Okay. Oh, perhaps today is the day we finally find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 或许今天我们终于要发现…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what's inside the Magic 8 Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}神奇八号球里是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did it when I was 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我四岁就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an icosahedral die floating in tinted blue water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面是二十面体的骰子 浮在蓝色液体中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:01:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man, call spoiler alert before you say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:01:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 要拆台之前 请先警告一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about the toaster oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那烤面包机呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did the toaster oven ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烤面包机对你做了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did I do to Jimmy Mullins in the third grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我三年级对吉米穆林做了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He still punched me in the face with my own fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还是用我的拳头 朝我的脸打了一拳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:16.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, you little nerd. You were just in the wrong boys' room at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:16.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 你这小笨蛋 你只是在错误的时间遇上错误的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:18.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:18.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 请戴护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, this is an auspicious moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吉时已到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like Robert Oppenheimer or Neil Armstrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像罗伯特奥本海默或阿姆斯特朗…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we need the appropriate words to mark this historic scientific event.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要合适的台词 来记录这件历史性的科学事件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about, "Die, toaster, die"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“死吧 面包机 死吧”如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 下一个换什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I think I'm just gonna stay in tonight and do laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我晚上想在家洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCREAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:33.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. This door got the full monty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:33.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 这扇门完全被“蒙提”了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Leonard? -Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A killer robot. We built it. -Yeah, well, it almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们造了台杀手机器人 -对 差点杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it wanted to kill you, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是我想杀你 你早就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who exactly does it wanna kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那它到底想杀谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, are you unaware of the upcoming...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 你没注意到即将来临的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Southern California Robot Fighting League Round Robin Invitational?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}南加州机器人对战联盟 循环邀请赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:02.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, since I moved last year, not all my mail has been forwarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:02.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从我去年搬家后 我的信没有全部转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a big deal, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可是件大事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's an awards banquet and a dance afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会有颁奖典礼 庆功舞会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps you'd like to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你想跟我一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know the other fellas would be really excited to see a girl there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道其他人一定很高兴 会有女生到场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is it supposed to be a dance if I'm the only girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果只有我一个女生 怎么能叫舞会？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that may be a slight exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么说可能有点夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd be the only doable girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是唯一值得上的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:31.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a pig, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:31.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你是头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:35.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is doable anything but a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:35.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}值得上是在赞美你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why don't we work on the robot? -Please, Leonard, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 我们来研究机器人吧 -拜托 莱纳德 现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:42.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once again, Penny and I have begun our little tango.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:42.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮和我又要开始跳我们的探戈了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our-- Our tango?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的探戈？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:47.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The carnal repartee, the erotic to and fro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:47.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肉体的往来 情欲的拉扯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:50.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But as delicious as the appetizer might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:50.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管开胃菜很美味…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:56.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at some point we will have to succumb and eat the entrée while it's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:56.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我们总会屈服吃下主菜 趁它还…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MIMICS SIZZLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}热时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm begging you, stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我求你 别再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, normally, I can just ignore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常我忽视你就可以了 我明白 你有点特殊 就像谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I get it. You're a little peculiar. Like Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:20.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, excuse me, Penny, but in this room, you're the one who's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打扰一下 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这房间里 你才是那个特殊份子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:28.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But back to you. You think you're some sort of smooth-talking ladies' man...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:28.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但回到你身上 你认为 你是花言巧语的少女杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the truth is you are just pathetic and creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但事实上 你只是可悲又古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:36.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am saying it is not a compliment to call me doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是指 说我值得上不算是称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is not sexy to stare at my ass and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且别自以为性感 盯着我的屁股说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[AS HOWARD] "Ooh, it must be jelly, because jam don't shake like that."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“一定是果冻 因为果酱不会这样晃”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] Most important, we are not dancing a tango.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且最重要的是 我们没跳探戈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:50.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not to-ing and fro-ing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:50.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有往来拉扯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:53.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing is ever gonna happen between us. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:53.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们之间 永远不会有什么事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. This isn't flirting. You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 这不是调情 你是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Flirting? You think I'm flirting with you? I am not flirting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}调情？你以为我对你调情？ 我才不会对你调情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No woman is ever gonna flirt with you. You're just gonna grow old and die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有女人会对你调情 你会孤独终老一生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for the heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, where are you going? -I'm going home...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 你要去哪里？ -我要回家…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:20.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to live my creepy, pathetic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:20.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过我古怪、可悲的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.95,0:05:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, y-- Someone had to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.95,0:05:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总得有人说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Uh, he said maybe we should enter you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -他说或许我们该…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the killer-robot competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你参加杀手机器人竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RAJESH CHUCKLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:55.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Howard, the phone is ringing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:55.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 电话在响
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:06:00.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's a crazy idea, Ma: answer it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:06:00.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个疯狂的主意 妈 接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's your friend, Leonard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你朋友 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:10.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wants to know why you're not at school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:10.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要知道你今天为何没去上学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't go to school, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 我不去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I work at a university.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在大学工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: That's a school. Now pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那也是学校 快接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想和任何人讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:25.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Should I ask Leonard to bring over your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:25.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要叫莱纳德把作业带过来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有作业
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a grown man with a Master's degree in Engineering!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是拿了工程学硕士学位的大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:35.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Excuse me, Mr. Fancy-Pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:35.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 这位公子哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Want me to get you a popsicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要我拿枝冰棒给你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cherry, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我樱桃口味的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: I ate the cherry. All that's left is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}樱桃口味的我吃了 只剩绿色的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You make me wanna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你让我想自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now they're just yelling about popsicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:52.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他们大叫着冰棒的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds like Penny really got to him. -I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听来佩妮真的伤了他 -我不意外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Despite his hard and crusty shell, Howard is a very sensitive man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在他坚硬的外壳下 霍华德是个非常敏感的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know he writes poetry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道他会写诗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mostly about men from Nantucket and hermits named Dave...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多半是关于一个南土克特来的人 还有个叫大维的隐士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:10.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but he does it with real sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:10.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他真的写得很感性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LISPING] Hey, Hofstadter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍夫斯塔特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:14.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Word around the plasma lab is you built a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:14.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等离子实验室有谣传 你们在造机器人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes, we did, Kripke. -His name is Monte.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 没错 克里普基 -他叫蒙提
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if you have any delusions about entering him against the Kripke Crippler...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是你们误以为它能 和我的克里普基残废者媲美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the Southern California Robot Fighting League Round Robin Invitational...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就一起来参加 南加州机器人对战联盟循环邀请赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...AKA the SCRFLRRI...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又称SCRFLRRI
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:31.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...his name is gonna be Scrap Metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:31.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它就得改名为破铜烂铁了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. Is that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 有必要这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I believe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我认为有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is trash talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是挑衅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trash talk is a traditional component in all sporting events.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}挑衅是所有运动中的传统成分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kripke...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:47.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your robot is inferior and it will be defeated by ours...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:47.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的次等机器人会被我们打败
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because ours exceeds yours in both design and execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们在设计与执行上 都比你优秀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also, I'm given to understand that your mother is overweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且 我也知道你母亲太肥了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔 真狠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that is a result of a glandular condition and not gluttony...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是腺分泌的影响 不是因为贪吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I withdraw that comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就收回我的批评
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What difference does it make? Fat is fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这有什么分别？胖就是胖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}损人也是有底线的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell you what, forget the SCRFLRRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你 别管SCRFLRRI了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Let's settle this roboto a roboto. -What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们来场机器人对决 -什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no guarantee we're gonna go against each other, so let's throw down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比赛不保证我们能对决 所以我们就先打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:28.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, unless you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:28.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非你们怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We accept your challenge. Name a time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们接受你的挑战 说出时间地点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Tomorrow, 3:00, the kinetics lab. -Make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-明天三点 动力实验室 -说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不要说定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Barry, we can't fight you tomorrow. Our engineer is incapacitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑞 明天不能和你打 我们的工程师废掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:41.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:41.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's depressed because he's pathetic and creepy and can't get girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很沮丧 因为他很可悲又古怪 而且找不到女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're all pathetic and creepy and can't get girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都很可悲又古怪 也找不到女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why we fight robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们才要举行机器人对打
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're not there, you'll be exposed to ridicule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:58.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们如果不出现 就等着当笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm curious, what part of America is that accent from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好奇 那是美国哪个地方的口音？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey, you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -有空吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:13.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, come on in. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:13.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 进来 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I need you to apologize to Howard-- -Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请你向霍华德道歉 -出去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. Wolowitz won't come out of his house and we need him for a robot battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得了吧 沃洛维茨不肯出家门 机器人战斗需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:23.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then have the robot go and get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:23.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就派机器人去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The robot didn't hurt his feelings. -His feelings needed to be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是机器人伤了他的感情 -他的感情需要被伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's been in bed for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他躺在床上两天了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, probably with a blow-up doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 或许还抱着充气娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not with a--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does it really matter who or what he's with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他抱着谁或抱着什么重要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The-- The guy is devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这家伙崩溃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. How could I possibly devastate Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 我怎么可能把霍华德弄崩溃？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, don't take this as a criticism...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我不是批评你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you do kind of have that overexposed-to-gamma-rays thing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你的确像是 过度曝露伽玛射线的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know. Like, most of the time, you're the easygoing Bruce Banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大多数时间 你是随和的布鲁斯班纳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then when you get angry, you kind of turn into like, you know:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:57.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过你生气时就变成…你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROWLS]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I turn into a bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}变成熊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously? Gamma rays? Bruce Banner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？伽玛射线？布鲁斯班纳？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't get The Incredible Hulk from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没联想到《无敌浩克》？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:11.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind. Just-- Please, just go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:11.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了 拜托 去和他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:14.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and say what? That I didn't mean it? Because I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:14.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说什么？我不是故意的？ 因为我是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe you can go at it from a different angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你可以用不同的角度说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:19.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like, you see a glimmer of goodness in him...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:19.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是你在他身上看到善良的闪光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you only said what you said because you want to nurture it and make it shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那么说只是因为 你要培育那道光 让它闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, pbbt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's try it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 试试这个方法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:34.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember the day we first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:34.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我们初次见面那天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you asked me to go to your boyfriend's apartment to get your TV back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你请我去你男朋友家 把你的电视搬回来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:42.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he was 9 feet tall and he took my pants off and you said--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:42.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他身高两米多 还把我裤子脱下来 然后你说…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was that? What did you s--?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？你说了什…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:48.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes. You said you owed me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:48.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 你说你欠我一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, come on, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 得了 那不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I came home with no pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回家时没穿裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. I'll go over there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我明天就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:59.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:59.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should probably give you a heads up about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我或许该提醒你他妈妈的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:08.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a delightful woman. You'll love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很讨人喜欢 你会爱上她的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:16.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Howard, there's a blond girl, Patsy, here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:16.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 有个金发女孩 叫派西的 来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:20.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁？ -好 她说她叫佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:20.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Okay, now she's saying it's Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想和她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: She ran past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她从我身边直接走过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was I supposed to tackle her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该把她扑倒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I just came by to see how you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是来看看你好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your mom seems nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈妈人好像不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:45.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People move away from her on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:45.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她坐公交车时 车上的人都会避开她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look, Howard...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 听着 霍华德…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I just want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是来道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For some things that I have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了我说的某些话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been informed that you have feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人告诉我你有感情…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and apparently, I have hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且显然被我伤害了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:26.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. You're sorry. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:26.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你很抱歉 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I'm a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 我是大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not traumatized by some random comment from some random woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会因为某个随机女人 说的随机评语就受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, get over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说 你别臭美了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HOWARD SOBBING]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就差那么一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CRASHING ON COMPUTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. That's Kripke's robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 那是克里普基的机器人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}KRIPKE [ON COMPUTER]: As you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:09.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如你所见 残废者正把 雪佛兰游骑兵切成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the Crippler is reducing the Chevy Cavalier to rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:11.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't watch anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:11.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢看了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, we have to call it off. -We don't have that option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:14.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我们得取消 -我们别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've accepted the challenge. We can't run away from a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们接受挑战了 不能临阵退缩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. We've spent our whole lives running away from fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 我们这辈子都在临阵退缩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Personally, I can squeeze through a hole in a fence half my size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就我个人而言 我能从 比我小一半的篱笆洞里钻过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, impressive as that may be, Monte is not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是令人钦佩 但蒙提不是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monte has no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙提无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, did we all not just watch the same video?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们刚看的 不是同一段录影吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:37.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kripke's robot just had angry sex with a mid-sized automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:37.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里普基的机器人 刚刚虐待完一台中型汽车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are overlooking the fact we know what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忽略了我们对敌人了如指掌的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we can modify Monte so that he's prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以调整蒙提 让它做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:44.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna prepare him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:44.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想让它做好准备？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Install a bladder and a pair of shorts so he can wet himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}装个膀胱 套条短裤 这样它就能吓得尿裤子了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:52.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are we gonna make any modifications without Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:52.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 没有沃洛维茨要怎么改装？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have you heard from Penny? -Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有佩妮的消息吗？ -还没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have faith, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要有信心 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't need Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不需要沃洛维茨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:14:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Engineering is merely the slow younger brother of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:14:01.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}工程学只是物理学 发育迟缓的小弟而己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看好了 学着点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do either of you know how to open the toolbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有谁知道怎么开工具箱？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then when I was 14...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我14岁时…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I met Marcy Grossman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我遇到玛西葛罗斯曼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:21.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:21.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:24.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She just got her braces off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:24.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她刚摘下牙套…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:27.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but they left a little of the overbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:27.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过还有点覆咬合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是火辣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:34.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like a sexy little chipmunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:34.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像性感的小花栗鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't have the courage to ask her out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有勇气约她出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:47.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I dedicated a song to her at the ninth-grade talent show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:47.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我在九年级的才艺表演 献了一首歌给她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aw, that sounds sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:52.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING TO THE TUNE OF "MY GIRL"] Marcy Grossman is sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:52.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛西葛罗斯曼是阴天里的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a cloudy day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一道阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When it's cold outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天寒地冻时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcy Grossman is the month of May
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛西葛萝斯曼就是五月天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:08.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess you'd say
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:08.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜你会说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What can make me feel this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是什么使我有这种感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcy Grossman, Marcy Grossman Marcy Grossman
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛西葛罗斯曼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Talkin' 'bout Marcy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说的就是玛西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grossman
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛罗斯曼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:24.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:24.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then she came up with that sexy little chipmunk mouth...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她用可爱的性感花栗鼠小嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and spit in my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朝我的头发吐口水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which brings us to 10th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后就是高一的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, do you think maybe sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你觉不觉得有时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you try too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太用力了点？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.57,0:15:44.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What chance do I have if I don't try too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我不用点力 还会有什么机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:55.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you have a terrific chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:55.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有大好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're smart, you're funny, you have a cool job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你聪明、风趣 有份很酷的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You build stuff that goes into outer space. -I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你建的东西会飞进外太空 -我想是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, look, I've known you for a year and a half...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 听着 我认识你一年半了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and this is the first time I feel like I'm talking to a real person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我第一次觉得我在和真人对话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:10.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know what? I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:10.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你知道吗？我喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的这么觉得？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:27.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HEARTBEAT POUNDING IN SLOW MOTION]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice little bot you've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这小机器人还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's this do, spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是做什么的 旋转？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep. At 3400 rpm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 每分钟3400转
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It can cut through steel like it was rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}切钢就和切橡胶一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we've gotta call this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们得取消
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For years, merciless thugs like Kripke have made my life a series of painful noogies...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多年来 像克里普基这种恶霸 害我一直被痛苦地按脖子打头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and humiliating wedgies and the insensitively named Indian burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}羞辱地拉内裤 还因为印第安酷刑害我手都麻了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, that stops now. -Sheldon, we don't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在一切都该停止了 -谢尔顿 我们没机会的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only improvement you were able to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你唯一做出来的改造
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was to put fresh batteries in the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是把遥控器换新电池
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you fail to realize is Kripke suffers from a fatal flaw:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不知道克里普基有个致命弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Overconfidence from his robot's massive size and its overwhelming power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:24.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对机器人巨大体积与惊人力量的过度自信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not overconfidence. That's observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是过度自信 那是洞悉一切
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trust me, Kripke will fall easy prey to my psychological warfare. Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 克里普基很快就会败给 我的心理战 看着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would ask if your robot is prepared to meet its maker...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想问问你的机器人 是否准备好见见它的制造者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but as you are its maker, clearly the two of you have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过既然你就是制造者 显然你们俩已经见过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Way to bust out the Jedi mind tricks, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:54.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想学绝地武士的心理战还差多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna make sure that we're all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要确认一下我们都清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:18:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Standard Robotic Fighting League rules apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:18:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}使用标准机器人战斗联盟规则
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a street fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是街头打斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The street has no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}街头没有规则
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's right, Leonard. The paradigm is to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说得对 莱纳德 打到死为止
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will, however, give you the opportunity to concede my superiority now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过 我给你们机会 现在就承认我比你们优越
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and offer me your robot as the spoils of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后把你们的机器人给我当战利品
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:19.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never. I'd rather see Monte dead than in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:19.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}休想 我宁愿看蒙提死 也不愿看它落入你手里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could be easily arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好办了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ready, set, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了 开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do it. -All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-动手 -那好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:29.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ready, set, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:29.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备 就位 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:35.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, Sheldon, you got this. -Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:35.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快点 谢尔顿 你可以的 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are prepared for anything he can throw at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们做好万全准备 应付他所有招数
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这招是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Run, Monte, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跑 蒙提 跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Run, Monte. LEONARD: Go. Go, Monte, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-跑 蒙提 -跑 蒙提 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Run, Monte. -Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-跑 蒙提 -快跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:19:00.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't hurt us, don't hurt us, don't hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:19:00.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别伤害我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:10.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, so much for making up for the emotional wounds of childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:10.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}弥补儿时的情绪创伤行动到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:13.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:13.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我害的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:16.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monte was killed by my hubris and my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:16.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙提因我的傲慢和骄傲被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No matter what anybody says, this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管其他人说什么 这是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one's arguing with you, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没人和你争辩 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got your text. How bad is--? Oi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我收到短信了 有多糟…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget the robot. What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别管机器人了 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He slipped and fell. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:32.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他滑倒了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I slipped and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我滑倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:35.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bounced right off the tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直接撞到浴缸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Now he knows what bathtubs are capable of doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他知道 要是不尊敬浴缸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:43.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when you don't treat them with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:43.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}浴缸能做出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:48.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They sucker-punch you when your eyes are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们会趁你闭上眼睛狠狠揍上一拳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think, Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为呢 霍华德？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:54.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It-- It's not that bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:54.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没那么糟 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no. A little electrical tape, some solder--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会 一点电器胶带 再焊一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've seen space probes that crashed into the desert that were in better shape than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太空探测器坠毁在沙漠时 情况都比这还要好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monte's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙提死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll bury him in the morning. A simple ceremony. I'll speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明早就埋了它 简单的仪式 我来主持
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you'll play your cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你要拉你的大提琴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, honey, aren't you getting a little carried away? I mean, it's just a toy robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你是不是有点走火入魔了 这只是个玩具机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a toy robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是玩具机器人？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:32.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:32.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:37.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:37.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:40.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:40.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The way I see it, I'm halfway to pity sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我看来 她很快就会因为同情 而跟我做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
